OL,3,GNEWSARonan Keating gig is 'huge boost
OL,4,Afor Colchester'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPop star Ronan Keating's world tour
OL,7,Fperforming in Colchester will be a
OL,8,F"huge boost" for the city, a councillor
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe former Boyzone frontman will take
OL,12,Fto the stage in Lower Castle Park on 21
OL,13,FAugust 2027.
OL,15,FHe will be joined by boy band Blue at
OL,16,Fthe Colchester Castle Summer Series
OL,17,Fevent.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
