OL,3,GNEWSARonan Keating gig is 'huge boost
OL,4,Afor Colchester'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These are artists with generations of
OL,7,Ffans, and it's fantastic to see our
OL,8,Fcity attracting acts of this calibre,"
OL,9,Fsaid Darius Laws, a Conservative city
OL,10,Fcouncillor.
